{
  "target": "Gitea 1.21 with seeded defects (scripts/seed_gitea_bugs.py --install)",
  "base_url": "http://localhost:3000/explore/repos",
  "notes": [
    "Steps match on visible label (`text`) rather than DOM id: Gitea's explore tabs, footer links and repository tab bar carry no ids at all. Label matching is the weaker selector, so check `script_fidelity` in meta.json after every capture — a silently skipped step produces a corpus missing the bug it was written to capture.",
    "Entry point is /explore/repos rather than / because five of the six defects live on or one click from the explore pages, and starting there keeps each episode short enough that the window (K=6) still contains the whole repro.",
    "happy_path is the negative control: every step is correct Gitea behaviour drawn from the answer key's false_positive_watch. Any bug reported during it is a false positive. It deliberately avoids repository home pages, which carry GITEA-06."
  ],
  "scripts": [
    {
      "name": "organizations_tab_opens_user_listing",
      "bugs": ["GITEA-01"],
      "steps": [
        {"type": "CLICK", "text": "Organizations"},
        {"type": "NO_OP"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "export_results_is_dead",
      "bugs": ["GITEA-02"],
      "steps": [
        {"type": "CLICK", "text": "Export results"},
        {"type": "NO_OP"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "account_unreachable_on_narrow_viewport",
      "bugs": ["GITEA-03"],
      "steps": [
        {"type": "RESIZE_VIEWPORT", "params": {"preset": "mobile"}},
        {"type": "NO_OP"},
        {"type": "RESIZE_VIEWPORT", "params": {"preset": "desktop"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "search_box_cleared_after_searching",
      "bugs": ["GITEA-04"],
      "steps": [
        {"type": "TYPE", "text": "q", "params": {"category": "valid_typical"}},
        {"type": "CLICK", "text": "Search"},
        {"type": "NO_OP"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "user_listing_throws",
      "bugs": ["GITEA-05"],
      "steps": [
        {"type": "CLICK", "text": "Users"},
        {"type": "NO_OP"},
        {"type": "NO_OP"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "repository_home_never_settles",
      "bugs": ["GITEA-06"],
      "steps": [
        {"type": "CLICK", "text": "tester / notes"},
        {"type": "NO_OP"},
        {"type": "NO_OP"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "happy_path",
      "bugs": [],
      "steps": [
        {"type": "CLICK", "text": "Repositories"},
        {"type": "NO_OP"},
        {"type": "REFRESH"},
        {"type": "SCROLL", "params": {"direction": "down"}},
        {"type": "CLICK", "text": "Register"},
        {"type": "NO_OP"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
